// Fall Line - a Y2K downhill hover-sled racer for the Mei console. No engine, no brakes:
// gravity and your line. One course, the Synergen Glacier Array, against the clock and the
// ghost of your best run (kept on the memory card).
//
// Stick or d-pad: carve. A: tuck (less drag, wider turns). B: hard edge (a tight turn that
// scrubs speed). START: start, pause. SELECT or B on the results: back to the title.
//
// This file is the cart's entry point; the game is in game.akr, so that the tests can import it
// with scripted input (tests/harness.akr replaces its weak input hooks).
cart "Fall Line", "FALLLINE"

import "game.akr"
